@host = http://localhost:5057

### Health check
GET {{host}}/redis/ping

### Set a value that expires in 60 seconds
POST {{host}}/redis/set
Content-Type: application/json

{ "key": "greeting", "value": "hello", "expiryMs": 60000 }

### Read it back
GET {{host}}/redis/get/greeting

### Push to a list
POST {{host}}/redis/rpush
Content-Type: application/json

{ "key": "tasks", "values": ["build", "test", "deploy"] }

### Read the list
GET {{host}}/redis/lrange/tasks?start=0&end=-1

### Append to a stream
POST {{host}}/redis/xadd
Content-Type: application/json

{ "streamKey": "events", "fields": { "action": "click", "page": "/home" } }

### Publish (open /redis/subscribe/news in another terminal with curl -N first)
POST {{host}}/redis/publish
Content-Type: application/json

{ "channel": "news", "message": "hello subscribers" }
